sequenceDiagram
  title Request a password reset email
  actor User
  participant Web as Next.js<br/>frontend
  participant Backend as Express backend<br/>(auth and email adapter)
  participant Prisma as Prisma<br/>Client
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant Resend as Resend<br/>email provider

  User->>Web: Submit email
  Web->>+Backend: POST /api/auth/password-reset/request<br/>(email)
  Backend->>Backend: Rate limit, validate,<br/>and normalize email
  Backend->>+Prisma: user.findUnique(normalizedEmail)
  Prisma->>DB: Find user by email
  DB-->>Prisma: User id and email
  Prisma-->>-Backend: Existing user

  Backend->>Backend: Generate reset token,<br/>hash it, and set expiry
  Backend->>+Prisma: $transaction(passwordResetToken.upsert)
  Prisma->>+DB: BEGIN
  Prisma->>DB: Insert or replace tokenHash,<br/>expiresAt, and usedAt = null
  DB-->>Prisma: Saved token id and hash
  Prisma->>DB: COMMIT
  DB-->>-Prisma: Committed
  Prisma-->>-Backend: Saved reset token

  Backend->>Backend: buildPasswordResetUrl(rawToken)
  Backend->>+Resend: emails.send(reset link)
  Resend-->>-Backend: API success
  Backend-->>-Web: Generic confirmation JSON
  Web-->>User: Show confirmation message
